# The portable files of the sift_col track (the column kernels, the shredder, docs/COL-SHRED.md; the aggregation operators, the design notes; the chunk and unit encoding, the design notes; the chunk codec): the same rule as portable.list (C library, intrinsics,
# sift_host.h and files of the lists; scripts/check-portable.sh enforces it) but not compiled by the SQLite and MariaDB hosts yet,
# which build portable.list only. Move a file to portable.list when a host needs it.
#
